{%- liquid
  assign raw_text = section.settings.marquee_text | default: 'BIS CERTIFIED ★ 100% ORGANIC COTTON ★ OEKO-TEX INKS ★ HYPOALLERGENIC ★ AGES 4–12 ★ FIVE ORIGINAL CHARACTERS ★ FREE SHIPPING OVER ₹999'
